<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Trading quiet after hours.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Trading quiet after hours.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Traders said after-hours activity was quiet on Friday.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said its session one volume was 22,300 shares compared 38,100 shares on Thursday. There was no sesson two volume compared to 844,600 shares on Thursday.</p>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said it had no after-hours volume.</p>
